{"id": "1-2098", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 27.007, "text": "About 2627 watts at the moment. Solar's done for the day, the load is 2627 watts, so we're drawing 2627 watts from the battery. That's roughly 6.4 hours at this rate."}
